WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.390
<i>Episode 15</i>

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:50.810
This is...

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:54.690
I'm screwed!

00:01:58.470 --> 00:01:59.890
What <i>is</i> that thing?

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:09.310
<i><i>Is this the ring Mochi was looking for?</i></i>

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:13.900
Where did this ring appear from?

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:16.220
You...

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:17.770
Are you hurt?

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:21.140
No, I'm fine. But you...

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:32.230
<i>This is...</i>

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:38.140
I am fine. Do not worry.

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:39.890
I am glad you are unharmed.

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:43.240
<i><i>He's the one who got hurt, 
but he only cares about me?</i></i>

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.390
What happened here?

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:55.740
Good timing! Help me carry him back!

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:04.500
<i><i>This man seems kind of familiar...</i></i>

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:21.930
We must hurry and dress his
wound to stop the bleeding.

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:50.060
But he's not bleeding.

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:52.560
What should I do?

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:57.820
He got hurt saving you.
We can't hesitate a moment longer.

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:13.810
Stop.

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:24.780
Grandpa Ginkgo, you stopped me from
 pulling out the stick. Is there a problem?

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.430
Let me take a look at the wound.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:45.390
It disappeared!

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:50.060
Okay, it is a regular wound now.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:53.660
If we dress the wound with 
these ointments I concocted,

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.980
there will not be any scarring.

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.310
Thank you, Ginkgo Fairy.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.650
It should be fine now.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:13.310
But why would a demon 
attack you in broad daylight?

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:17.100
By the way, I saw the ring you 
were looking for on his finger.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:20.070
I didn't see any ring on his finger.

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:23.830
Yeah, but listen...

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:28.150
After the demon disappeared, 
the ring slowly vanished, too.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:30.370
The ring did not vanish.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:34.750
The ring only appears when he is in danger,

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:38.100
then becomes invisible again 
when the danger has passed.

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:42.330
You're awake?

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:43.470
Water...

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:56.300
There.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:02.220
How do you feel now? Does your wound still hurt?

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:04.120
No...

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:06.640
<i>Seems Ginkgo Fairy's 
ointment is very effective.</i>

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:10.100
That's great. I'm relieved you're all right.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:14.730
This <i>is</i> a surprise. My dear 
wife is concerned about me.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:19.040
W-Well, yeah. You got hurt because of me. I'm sorry.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.720
Is that the only reason?

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:27.200
Of course. What other reason would I have?

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.760
<i>I still have not got through to her...</i>

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:35.330
<i>He's mad at me? What did I do?</i>

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:39.140
Anyway, let me call for a doctor
 to come check you over.

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:41.640
Wait a moment.

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:44.380
What are these things?

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:49.410
Wh-What are you pointing at?

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:50.850
Well... them.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.470
Y-You can see them?

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.430
You can see spirits now, too?

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:04.910
Today is the first time 
I have seen these things...

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:07.020
It all started when that ring appeared.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:12.180
I saw the thing that attacked us,
then suddenly disappeared.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:17.650
Is this really your first time seeing them?
Why are you not surprised or scared at all?

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:20.930
You can see them, too. Are you scared of them?

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:25.180
No way. Why would I be scared of them?

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:30.380
I have a lot of spirit friends. 
They're nice and friendly to me.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:32.400
Why should I be scared?

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.540
This is Mei, the Flower Fairy.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:40.950
She made the Jizi orchid garland 
I presented to Princess Lanshuang.

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:43.930
And this is Muqing, who 
helped me clean the palace.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:48.300
This is Grandpa Ginkgo. 
He's the one who just saved you.

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:51.930
This is Sesame. He was the 
Serenity Pavilion troublemaker.

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:54.940
And this is my contract ghost, Mochi.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:08:00.390
So when you said Sesame and Mochi, 
you actually meant these two?

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:03.520
Did I mention them to you before?

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:05.510
What about the one who attacked you?

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:07.270
I don't know that one.

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:10.600
I was sent to Spirit Cloud Mountain
because I had this ability.

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:13.840
I've lived on Spirit Cloud Mountain 
for as long as I can remember...

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:17.970
Anyway, why am I telling you all this?

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.560
Oh, right!

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:23.250
Mochi, you weren't able 
to get close to him before.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.640
Why can you now?

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:26.960
You're right!

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:30.550
It is because the demon realm crystal 
on the ring, which creates a barrier

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:33.870
to prevent demons and spirits from 
approaching, has been destroyed.

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:36.390
Demon realm crystal?

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:38.910
Barrier?

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:42.160
That is why he can see us now.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:47.160
The barrier's been broken, so all demons
 and spirits can get near him now.

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:48.290
Precisely.

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:53.640
But why do demons and 
spirits want to get near you?

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.890
Who gave you that protective barrier?

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:03.600
Well, in any case, I'll protect you from now on.

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:10.540
Never fear! I will also 
help you to keep him safe!

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:01.360
<i><i>It has already healed.</i></i>

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:17.560
It's difficult for you, right?

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.560
Hot...

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:34.420
What are you doing?

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.250
Wh-What's wrong?

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:56.930
What are you do—

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.290
<i><i>Oh, fine.</i></i>

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:09.020
<i><i>He got hurt because of me. </i></i>

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.860
<i><i>I can't just not take care of him.</i></i>

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:41.520
When's he gonna wake up? Seriously...

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.140
<i><i>Wait! Did he just... </i></i>

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:45.520
When did you open your eyes?

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:48.220
A while ago.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:51.760
Then, think you could let go of my hand?

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:55.970
Or I'll have to...

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:59.560
Not biting it?

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:01.390
It's difficult to bite it.

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:05.390
<i><i>I know!</i></i>

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:16.370
Are you really a man?

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:19.540
Why's your hand smoother 
than a woman's? Damn.

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:23.470
If you are quite finished,
lie down quietly beside me.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:36.390
Don't think I won't do anything 
to you just because you're injured.

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:38.820
All right. Go ahead.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.820
You can do anything you like to me.

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:53.600
Open the door!

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.010
I want to see His Highness!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.370
B-Beauty Chu...

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:15.320
His Highness has ordered 
that he must not be disturbed.

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:21.600
Su Rong, I have yet to ask you: Why did you
not tell me the prince was so badly injured?

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:23.100
Well, I...

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:27.100
How dare you stand in my way...
Am I nothing to you?

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:28.930
But...

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:32.970
Please do not go inside. 
His Highness will blame me.

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:35.390
Move out of my way!

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:45.770
Beauty Chu?

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:47.470
Oh, it is you...

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:49.370
Move aside.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:56.960
Your Highness.

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:00.800
Who let you into my chamber?

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:05.700
I-I heard you were hurt 
and I was worried about you.

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:08.140
So I came in of my own accord.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:09.640
Presumptuous of you.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:13.500
How dare you offend the 
princess in front of me...

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.140
Do you know your crime?

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:19.220
<i>That harlot... Curse her.</i>

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:24.280
Even if you punish me, I will still come 
and take care of you, Your Highness.

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:25.830
Get out.

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:28.720
But I still have to take care of you...

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:32.520
No need. The princess being here is enough.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:37.440
I understand. Farewell, Your Highness.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:40.270
Su Rong!

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:43.390
Yes, Highness?

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:46.270
Where is the princess?

00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:50.540
Your Highness, Her Highness said that, 
since someone was here to take care of you,

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.270
she would go back and rest.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.770
<i><i>That woman truly is dense.</i></i>

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:05.770
Mistress, are you okay?

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.430
I am fine.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.620
Did His Highness drink the 
herbal medicine you prepared?

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:16.960
No.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.970
That contemptible woman
 was there when I went in.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.620
His Highness used to get me to take care of him,

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:26.370
but now, he will not even let me 
near the Hall of Esteemed Virtue.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:29.500
That woman must be using
 evil witchcraft on him.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:31.680
I must bring His Highness to his senses.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:35.120
I believe it, too.

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:40.770
You were slapped in the garden that time,
the ginkgo tree came back to life,

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:42.160
and His Highness was injured.

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:45.160
All of the servants are saying 
that the princess uses witchcraft.

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:47.770
I thought as much.

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:54.160
Chief Taoist Meihai, the one you 
asked me to invite before, has returned.

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:57.530
Invite him to the palace immediately.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:00.770
And damn the expense.

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:04.190
Yes, mistress. I understand.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:05.500
Wait.

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:10.430
Tell the other concubines about this as well.

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:15.520
Let them all come along and make a scene.

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:18.520
Yes, mistress.
